WEBVTT

00:11.010 --> 00:13.130
<b><i>Study time</i></b>

00:15.930 --> 00:17.600
<b><i>Do you really want to help her?</i></b>

00:18.100 --> 00:20.560
<b><i>What do you think? Think about it, it’s not fair.</i></b>

00:21.060 --> 00:24.020
<b><i>They don’t have the right to treat her like that.</i></b>

00:24.350 --> 00:26.600
<b><i>Maybe, but they don’t care.</i></b>

00:26.860 --> 00:29.020
<b><i>All it takes is for them to dislike you.</i></b>

00:30.320 --> 00:34.150
<b><i>Still… she gave me a look. She wanted help.</i></b>

00:34.450 --> 00:37.200
<b><i>We were just there at the right time, nothing more.</i></b>

00:37.910 --> 00:40.580
<b><i>I can’t do anything for you if you get involved in this.</i></b>

00:41.410 --> 00:44.830
<b><i>You’re going to become their next target.</i></b>

00:45.210 --> 00:46.710
<b><i>And that girl, then?</i></b>

00:47.290 --> 00:48.170
<b><i>Not my problem.</i></b>

00:48.340 --> 00:51.380
<b><i>Either she toughs it out or she drops out of school.</i></b>

00:51.550 --> 00:53.590
<b><i>Unless a teacher steps in.</i></b>

00:53.970 --> 00:55.550
<b><i>And we’re just going to abandon her?</i></b>

00:55.840 --> 00:57.760
<b><i>You’re so stubborn.</i></b>

00:58.050 --> 01:01.180
<b><i>You have a knack for making me angry. Yeah, I’ve had enough.</i></b>

01:01.470 --> 01:02.930
<b><i>You’re not the only one!</i></b>

01:03.560 --> 01:05.060
<b><i>I see where you’re coming from.</i></b>

01:05.810 --> 01:07.650
<b><i>But it’s cowardly.</i></b>

01:08.230 --> 01:11.320
<b><i>They can’t get away with this.</i></b>

01:13.650 --> 01:15.200
<b><i>I won’t stand for it.</i></b>

01:24.790 --> 01:25.790
<b>Was it a dream?</b>

01:27.750 --> 01:30.590
<b>Is today the day I have to go to the agency?</b>

01:32.050 --> 01:33.840
<b>Great, I overslept.</b>

03:04.600 --> 03:09.480
<b>**ROCK NEVER DIES**</b>

03:06.720 --> 03:09.480
<b>We haven’t met half of the target.</b>

03:09.850 --> 03:10.890
<b>No surprise.</b>

03:11.060 --> 03:12.850
<b>The video was a flop.</b>

03:13.100 --> 03:15.230
<b>It’s normal not to gain subscribers.</b>

03:15.730 --> 03:17.820
<b>Where do you think the problem lies?</b>

03:18.690 --> 03:20.070
<b>Well, the problem is</b>

03:20.240 --> 03:23.870
<b>that you’ve never had this much visibility before.</b>

03:24.280 --> 03:27.200
<b>Your name is being searched a lot online.</b>

03:27.450 --> 03:31.210
<b>Logically, it should bring you views.</b>

03:31.410 --> 03:32.960
<b>But it’s not the case.</b>

03:33.120 --> 03:34.210
<b>It’s my fault.</b>

03:34.880 --> 03:37.210
<b>An agent should know how to promote their clients.</b>

03:37.590 --> 03:38.710
<b>My apologies.</b>

03:40.130 --> 03:41.930
<b>I’m not blaming you…</b>

03:42.090 --> 03:44.180
<b>In the era of self-promotion,</b>

03:44.720 --> 03:47.430
<b>agencies need to evolve and adapt.</b>

03:47.640 --> 03:51.430
<b>What’s the point for an artist to stay if they don’t see any benefit?</b>

03:52.230 --> 03:53.020
<b>Well said.</b>

03:53.190 --> 03:56.440
<b>Give me some time. I’ll turn things around.</b>

03:58.150 --> 04:01.570
<b>- I’ve never seen her like that.
- She was acting strange, indeed.</b>

04:01.950 --> 04:03.410
<b>Where’s Momoka?</b>

04:03.570 --> 04:05.620
<b>She left after saying, “Sorry, see you later.”</b>

04:06.450 --> 04:07.330
<b>Seriously?</b>

04:07.490 --> 04:09.330
<b>We were supposed to rehearse.</b>

04:09.790 --> 04:12.580
<b>- Let’s forget it for today.
- I agree.</b>

04:13.620 --> 04:17.250
<b>- Momoka hit the nail on the head.
- It was obvious.</b>

04:17.420 --> 04:19.590
<b>- What do you mean?
- You’re so slow.</b>

04:19.920 --> 04:22.130
<b>- What?
- You heard Miura.</b>

04:22.300 --> 04:25.970
<b>Our name sells, but not our music. See the logic?</b>

04:26.140 --> 04:27.720
<b>Something’s wrong with our compositions.</b>

04:28.720 --> 04:31.850
<b>Miura knew what conclusion Momoka would come to.</b>

04:32.020 --> 04:33.730
<b>She wanted to spare her.</b>

04:33.890 --> 04:34.600
<b>But why?</b>

04:34.980 --> 04:36.980
<b>To avoid hurting Momoka.</b>

04:37.150 --> 04:39.360
<b>Stop it, we just need to be patient!</b>

04:39.610 --> 04:42.820
<b>It’s a hit in the making! Everyone loves it.</b>

04:42.990 --> 04:44.490
<b>Even Miura and Nakata!</b>

04:44.650 --> 04:47.780
<b>Nobody would struggle if it were easy to be successful.</b>

04:47.990 --> 04:48.490
<b>But…</b>

04:48.950 --> 04:52.830
<b>You know, during his lifetime, Van Gogh only sold one painting.</b>

04:53.200 --> 04:53.790
<b>Wait…</b>

04:53.960 --> 04:56.710
<b>Basically, people follow trends.</b>

04:56.880 --> 04:59.880
<b>They consume anything as long as it’s well-promoted.</b>

05:00.210 --> 05:02.800
<b>But they won’t jump in unless others do.</b>

05:02.960 --> 05:04.170
<b>That’s not…</b>

05:04.510 --> 05:05.760
<b>Not true, you think?</b>

05:06.220 --> 05:07.800
<b>Take <i>Let’s Play,</i>,</b>

05:08.140 --> 05:11.390
<b>would you click on the one with 5,000 views or the one with 1 million?</b>

05:25.610 --> 05:27.660
<b>Stop it. You’re embarrassing me.</b>

05:27.820 --> 05:29.570
<b>I hope so.</b>

05:29.740 --> 05:32.950
<b>**THE NEXT DAY**</b>

05:30.490 --> 05:32.950
<b><i>“It’s a losing battle.”</i></b>

05:33.290 --> 05:36.290
<b><i>“They’re so pretentious, it annoys me.”</i></b>

05:36.540 --> 05:38.330
<b><i>“They should just quit.”</i></b>

05:39.330 --> 05:41.340
<b>Screw you!</b>

05:42.630 --> 05:45.130
<b>You talk without even listening to our music!</b>

05:45.300 --> 05:49.760
<b>We won’t prove you right! And we’re not doing this for you!</b>

05:51.760 --> 05:54.470
<b>Breathe, breathe…</b>

05:56.810 --> 05:58.400
<b>Diamond Dust, on the other hand,</b>

05:58.770 --> 06:01.150
<b>sold all their tickets for our duel.</b>

06:01.440 --> 06:02.730
<b>Not surprising…</b>

06:05.530 --> 06:06.860
<b>A subscription request?</b>

06:07.360 --> 06:07.860
<b>From Hina?</b>

06:10.160 --> 06:11.700
<b>It’s a verified account.</b>

06:21.000 --> 06:21.540
<b>Hi.</b>

06:25.380 --> 06:27.010
<b>You’re silly, I totally got you.</b>

06:29.970 --> 06:31.050
<b>It’s been a while.</b>

06:32.100 --> 06:34.140
<b>Don’t you need to keep a low profile?</b>

06:34.310 --> 06:36.560
<b>I’m far from being well-known enough.</b>

06:36.980 --> 06:38.390
<b>You still eat those, then.</b>

06:38.560 --> 06:41.690
<b>Yes. We always bought them after school!</b>

06:42.020 --> 06:42.940
<b>I can pay.</b>

06:43.230 --> 06:44.940
<b>No, I’ll cover it this time.</b>

06:46.690 --> 06:48.400
<b>- So what do you want?
- Nothing.</b>

06:48.780 --> 06:51.110
<b>I just wanted to clear up any misunderstanding.</b>

06:51.280 --> 06:52.070
<b>Like what?</b>

06:52.240 --> 06:56.200
<b>I didn’t become their new singer on purpose.</b>

06:56.450 --> 06:58.710
<b>I told you about the auditions.</b>

06:59.160 --> 07:02.000
<b>Right. That was after we stopped talking</b>

07:02.170 --> 07:04.210
<b>and you left school.</b>

07:04.500 --> 07:06.340
<b>So, what, you came to gloat?</b>

07:06.500 --> 07:09.510
<b>That I wouldn’t have suffered if I had listened to you?</b>

07:09.670 --> 07:12.840
<b>That things wouldn’t have gotten out of hand if I had followed your advice?</b>

07:13.140 --> 07:14.050
<b>Exactly.</b>

07:14.220 --> 07:16.220
<b>That’s what I’d like to tell you.</b>

07:17.600 --> 07:19.980
<b>- It’s not selling, huh?
- None of your business.</b>

07:20.270 --> 07:22.520
<b>I think it is, actually.</b>

07:22.690 --> 07:24.230
<b>We’re playing together, after all.</b>

07:24.400 --> 07:25.230
<b>Not at all!</b>

07:26.900 --> 07:30.360
<b>You know, your agent, Miura, paid us a visit.</b>

07:30.530 --> 07:31.860
<b>To ask for help.</b>

07:32.110 --> 07:32.990
<b>Seriously?</b>

07:33.160 --> 07:35.700
<b>She wanted us to play both days</b>

07:35.870 --> 07:39.250
<b>since we can sell out the tickets in no time.</b>

07:39.790 --> 07:43.380
<b>On your side, you’re only filling the venue to 30% of its capacity.</b>

07:43.790 --> 07:48.460
<b>We’re available on that date, it’ll depend on what we decide.</b>

07:49.130 --> 07:52.130
<b>But I wanted to know what you all thought about it.</b>

07:53.180 --> 07:53.680
<b>So?</b>

07:54.340 --> 07:55.180
<b>I don’t care.</b>

07:55.470 --> 07:58.430
<b>Should I take that as a no?</b>

07:58.600 --> 08:00.890
<b>Or that you feel indebted?</b>

08:04.810 --> 08:05.860
<b>Do you hear that?</b>

08:06.190 --> 08:09.030
<b>It’s called success. It’s important.</b>

08:09.280 --> 08:10.360
<b>Even crucial.</b>

08:10.690 --> 08:13.110
<b>What if you finally accepted reality?</b>

08:13.410 --> 08:17.580
<b>You were wrong. And I was right.</b>

08:17.740 --> 08:20.120
<b>Admit that you should have listened to me.</b>

08:22.540 --> 08:25.330
<b>You weren't ready to clear the air?</b>

08:26.960 --> 08:30.380
<b>Accept your failure and I'll come to your rescue.</b>

08:32.670 --> 08:33.590
<b>I'm out of here.</b>

08:35.550 --> 08:36.430
<b>Your money!</b>

08:37.930 --> 08:39.560
<b>That was awesome, really!</b>

08:44.270 --> 08:46.770
<b>- Hello?
- Sorry for the disturbance.</b>

08:47.770 --> 08:48.610
<b>Don't worry.</b>

08:48.900 --> 08:50.320
<b>Is there a problem?</b>

08:50.570 --> 08:53.450
<b>Well, I've already mentioned it to the girls…</b>

08:53.700 --> 08:58.320
<b>DD would like us to play both days.</b>

08:58.490 --> 09:00.950
<b>So we can face off before the same audience.</b>

09:01.830 --> 09:04.960
<b>I guess Miura told you about this.</b>

09:05.250 --> 09:07.750
<b>- Yes, does it surprise you?
- Not at all.</b>

09:07.920 --> 09:09.090
<b>What do you think, Nina?</b>

09:09.500 --> 09:10.840
<b>And you guys?</b>

09:11.210 --> 09:12.050
<b>Well…</b>

09:12.210 --> 09:16.970
<b>I'm for it, it seems more fair.</b>

09:17.470 --> 09:20.180
<b>Okay, but if we choose this option,</b>

09:20.350 --> 09:24.230
<b>it means DD will bring in most of the audience.</b>

09:24.730 --> 09:28.480
<b>Isn't that admitting our defeat?</b>

09:29.110 --> 09:30.980
<b>So you're against this idea, then?</b>

09:31.270 --> 09:32.360
<b>Yes, absolutely.</b>

09:32.940 --> 09:33.900
<b>Here we go.</b>

09:34.070 --> 09:35.900
<b>Listen, I understand you…</b>

09:36.990 --> 09:39.160
<b>I don't want it. No way!</b>

09:39.410 --> 09:41.910
<b>We've struggled too much to get here!</b>

09:42.080 --> 09:43.500
<b>Momoka is right.</b>

09:43.660 --> 09:47.750
<b>And we're here to show the world that her music has an impact!</b>

09:47.920 --> 09:50.290
<b>That's always been our driving force!</b>

09:50.460 --> 09:53.210
<b>But reality will always catch up with us.</b>

09:53.800 --> 09:56.880
<b>We're barely filling 30% of the venue.</b>

09:57.430 --> 09:58.890
<b>It's worse than when we started.</b>

09:59.390 --> 10:00.890
<b>So what, huh?</b>

10:01.050 --> 10:02.810
<b>Will you take responsibility then?</b>

10:03.350 --> 10:05.100
<b>Do you have any idea how much money has been invested?</b>

10:06.100 --> 10:08.440
<b>- Money?
- And I'm not just talking about the venue.</b>

10:08.810 --> 10:13.230
<b>Merchandise and advertising, it's far from free.</b>

10:13.530 --> 10:16.440
<b>We need to find a way to recoup the losses.</b>

10:16.780 --> 10:18.200
<b>This is all my fault.</b>

10:18.860 --> 10:19.410
<b>Sorry.</b>

10:22.410 --> 10:25.160
<b>So we also have to bow down to DD?</b>

10:26.370 --> 10:28.790
<b>That's not what we're saying.</b>

10:28.960 --> 10:31.840
<b>Yes, we're just accepting an arrangement.</b>

10:32.000 --> 10:32.840
<b>We're bowing down!</b>

10:33.250 --> 10:35.840
<b>Do you think they made a move towards us?</b>

10:36.300 --> 10:37.220
<b>What do you mean?</b>

10:37.590 --> 10:39.180
<b>It's obvious.</b>

10:39.430 --> 10:41.800
<b>Miura groveled at their feet.</b>

10:43.010 --> 10:46.560
<b>She begged them to play with us.</b>

10:46.730 --> 10:47.350
<b>Really?</b>

10:47.520 --> 10:49.310
<b>And who told you that?</b>

10:49.640 --> 10:50.810
<b>Hina.</b>

10:51.150 --> 10:53.730
<b>She wanted me to acknowledge her victory.</b>

10:54.020 --> 10:56.440
<b>In return, she would help us.</b>

10:57.110 --> 10:59.490
<b>But I refuse that.</b>

11:00.030 --> 11:01.450
<b>Because I know</b>

11:01.910 --> 11:03.070
<b>I'm right!</b>

11:05.370 --> 11:06.080
<b>Nina…</b>

11:08.370 --> 11:10.670
<b>You don't have the right to give up!</b>

11:19.670 --> 11:22.510
<b>You can't deny who I was!</b>

11:24.510 --> 11:26.770
<b>Money, responsibility, popularity…</b>

11:26.930 --> 11:28.640
<b>I'm not stupid!</b>

11:29.060 --> 11:32.020
<b>Just frustrated… Frustrated!</b>

11:32.440 --> 11:34.020
<b>I've had enough!</b>

11:36.860 --> 11:37.780
<b>- Nina?
- Are you okay?</b>

11:37.940 --> 11:38.780
<b>Nothing broken?</b>

11:39.740 --> 11:42.740
<b>Why am I so weak, huh?</b>

11:52.080 --> 11:53.460
<b><i>Did they do this to you?</i></b>

11:54.460 --> 11:57.710
<b><i>I warned you. I can't help you.</i></b>

11:58.300 --> 12:00.760
<b><i>What did I ever do to you?</i></b>

12:01.260 --> 12:05.010
<b><i>You have this knack for making me uncomfortable every time we talk.</i></b>

12:05.350 --> 12:09.890
<b><i>Your so-called sense of justice does more harm than good.</i></b>

12:11.020 --> 12:13.900
<b><i>You make me feel like the bad guy.</i></b>

12:15.020 --> 12:17.650
<b>- And you haven't spoken since.
- That's right.</b>

12:17.980 --> 12:20.990
<b>Well, this story doesn't surprise me about you.</b>

12:21.280 --> 12:24.240
<b>And that girl who was being bullied?</b>

12:24.860 --> 12:26.620
<b>It's super ironic,</b>

12:26.780 --> 12:30.540
<b>but she targeted me with her former bullies.</b>

12:30.830 --> 12:34.620
<b>Then she found me privately and asked me to apologize.</b>

12:34.870 --> 12:36.710
<b>They would let it go</b>

12:37.040 --> 12:39.800
<b>and I wouldn't have to be their target anymore.</b>

12:39.960 --> 12:41.050
<b>It's unbelievable.</b>

12:41.300 --> 12:42.970
<b>She was trembling.</b>

12:43.470 --> 12:45.050
<b>She was afraid of them.</b>

12:45.260 --> 12:48.760
<b>But you helped her. She owes you, right?</b>

12:48.930 --> 12:51.060
<b>That's why you left school.</b>

12:51.810 --> 12:52.310
<b>Yes.</b>

12:52.770 --> 12:54.810
<b>Because you knew you were right.</b>

12:54.980 --> 12:58.190
<b>But you were wrong! Wrong all along!</b>

12:58.360 --> 12:59.190
<b>Tomo…</b>

12:59.360 --> 13:03.740
<b>For what outcome? It was Hina who had it right!</b>

13:04.150 --> 13:04.900
<b>Still…</b>

13:05.700 --> 13:06.320
<b>Yes…</b>

13:07.620 --> 13:09.910
<b>that's also what makes you charming.</b>

13:10.370 --> 13:12.040
<b>I love your voice.</b>

13:12.250 --> 13:15.040
<b>And Rupa, Momoka, and Subaru probably do too.</b>

13:16.500 --> 13:17.000
<b>Tomo!</b>

13:18.790 --> 13:20.300
<b>- Hands off!
- Come on!</b>

13:20.710 --> 13:22.710
<b>I can't stand it!</b>

13:24.010 --> 13:25.430
<b>We have our answer.</b>

13:25.590 --> 13:28.760
<b>Miura worked hard to get this deal.</b>

13:28.930 --> 13:30.560
<b>We’ll have to explain ourselves.</b>

13:31.390 --> 13:32.560
<b>I can't believe it…</b>

13:32.850 --> 13:37.440
<b>But it was a more than predictable turn.</b>

13:37.940 --> 13:39.190
<b>We're talking about Nina.</b>

13:39.400 --> 13:40.610
<b>Yes, that's true.</b>

13:40.940 --> 13:41.690
<b>It's not nice.</b>

13:44.610 --> 13:47.070
<b>- You're refusing?
- Yes, our apologies.</b>

13:47.360 --> 13:50.830
<b>They want a proper duel, you know.</b>

13:51.120 --> 13:52.040
<b>We're aware.</b>

13:52.240 --> 13:56.460
<b>But it would look like they're coming to our rescue.</b>

13:56.710 --> 13:59.880
<b>Maybe, but regarding the audience…</b>

14:00.630 --> 14:03.460
<b><i>Withdrawal request</i></b>

14:01.540 --> 14:03.460
<b>It's our decision.</b>

14:03.710 --> 14:07.130
<b>We know how much it can seem like a whim,</b>

14:07.380 --> 14:10.510
<b>and how it impacts the agency's finances.</b>

14:10.800 --> 14:13.100
<b>Please inform us of the incurred costs.</b>

14:13.430 --> 14:18.100
<b>I can't say when, but we will reimburse you.</b>

14:18.900 --> 14:20.020
<b>Please.</b>

14:22.230 --> 14:23.690
<b>I beg you.</b>

14:24.530 --> 14:25.860
<b>Why this choice?</b>

14:27.700 --> 14:28.910
<b>I got a message.</b>

14:29.530 --> 14:31.620
<b>From Hina from DD herself.</b>

14:32.160 --> 14:33.990
<b>Your dedication touches me.</b>

14:34.450 --> 14:38.500
<b>You went to great lengths to make this project possible.</b>

14:38.870 --> 14:42.340
<b>And I am sincerely sorry to have to decline this offer.</b>

14:42.960 --> 14:45.960
<b>Forgive my selfishness.</b>

14:47.550 --> 14:52.350
<b>I suspected it would go against your principles.</b>

14:52.800 --> 14:55.350
<b>- Miura…
- I haven't been a good agent.</b>

14:56.020 --> 14:57.480
<b>But let's be clear.</b>

14:57.640 --> 15:00.850
<b>The money is our responsibility, not yours.</b>

15:01.860 --> 15:05.110
<b>It's your personality that made me want to work with you.</b>

15:05.280 --> 15:08.110
<b><i>Withdrawal request</i></b>

15:05.730 --> 15:07.780
<b>At least let me fix my mistake.</b>

15:08.740 --> 15:09.490
<b>Are you leaving?</b>

15:09.950 --> 15:10.610
<b>Yes.</b>

15:10.910 --> 15:14.580
<b>- For another agency?
- No, we're going solo.</b>

15:14.870 --> 15:16.330
<b>Was there a problem?</b>

15:16.620 --> 15:17.370
<b>None.</b>

15:17.660 --> 15:19.660
<b>It's our own decision.</b>

15:19.830 --> 15:20.580
<b>Nothing more.</b>

15:23.000 --> 15:25.340
<b>- He disagrees?
- I think it's rash.</b>

15:28.630 --> 15:31.300
<b>Come see me in 10 years if you hold up.</b>

15:31.550 --> 15:32.840
<b>I'll work for free.</b>

15:34.600 --> 15:37.720
<b>Great, thank you so much, Nakata!</b>

15:38.600 --> 15:39.980
<b>A nice bowl of beef.</b>

15:40.270 --> 15:41.730
<b>You want to get wasted.</b>

15:41.980 --> 15:43.150
<b>Of course not.</b>

15:43.310 --> 15:44.610
<b>Sure…</b>

15:45.230 --> 15:48.860
<b>This is where we met.</b>

15:49.280 --> 15:50.030
<b>That's true.</b>

15:50.950 --> 15:52.280
<b>Beni-Shoga, right?</b>

15:53.240 --> 15:55.240
<b>How about we make a vow?</b>

15:55.870 --> 15:58.330
<b>This name has sentimental value.</b>

15:58.540 --> 16:00.000
<b>And so does a vow.</b>

16:00.460 --> 16:01.500
<b>What kind of promise?</b>

16:02.250 --> 16:05.750
<b>The promise to always stay together and never give up.</b>

16:07.000 --> 16:09.710
<b>- No choice but to eat here.
- Works for me.</b>

16:09.880 --> 16:11.130
<b>Just one drink.</b>

16:12.130 --> 16:13.050
<b>Momoka!</b>

16:14.390 --> 16:16.510
<b>You know, I love this city.</b>

16:17.350 --> 16:20.850
<b>I love my life here, where I’m free to laughand cry</b>

16:21.230 --> 16:22.190
<b>with my friends.</b>

16:23.480 --> 16:24.440
<b>Kawasaki, right?</b>

16:25.440 --> 16:26.060
<b>Yes!</b>

16:33.150 --> 16:34.490
<b>Beaten to a pulp.</b>

16:34.740 --> 16:37.450
<b>It's like losing every match in a championship.</b>

16:37.740 --> 16:39.490
<b>And a miracle, huh?</b>

16:40.120 --> 16:42.790
<b>Dream on. This isn’t a B-movie.</b>

16:42.960 --> 16:43.960
<b>You like that?</b>

16:44.210 --> 16:46.580
<b>I only watch 
<i>Grandma’s Investigations</i>!</b>

16:48.000 --> 16:49.500
<b>Are you teasing me?</b>

16:49.670 --> 16:51.760
<b>Well, we expected it.</b>

16:51.920 --> 16:56.090
<b>We knew everything would work against us, that we’d struggle.</b>

16:56.260 --> 16:57.850
<b>How ironic!</b>

16:58.220 --> 17:00.520
<b>You were by far the most lost.</b>

17:00.810 --> 17:01.770
<b>Okay, fine.</b>

17:02.100 --> 17:05.150
<b>Well, another thing that proves you right.</b>

17:06.020 --> 17:06.770
<b>Momoka.</b>

17:07.020 --> 17:10.980
<b>By the way, with DD's concert yesterday, we got a lot of comments.</b>

17:11.150 --> 17:13.400
<b>You told me not to read them.</b>

17:13.570 --> 17:14.530
<b>Apparently.</b>

17:14.990 --> 17:15.860
<b>Let's see.</b>

17:16.030 --> 17:17.530
<b>"I like them.</b>

17:17.950 --> 17:19.910
<b>"Why are people hating on them?</b>

17:20.200 --> 17:22.660
<b>"Who cares, music isn’t about numbers.</b>

17:23.250 --> 17:25.670
<b>"Nothing is ever truly lost."</b>

17:26.120 --> 17:30.170
<b>See, they could just walk away, but they don’t.</b>

17:30.920 --> 17:33.420
<b>We’re reaching people, then.</b>

17:34.630 --> 17:35.590
<b>Seems so.</b>

17:36.760 --> 17:40.430
<b>Anyway, your guitar progress is absolutely amazing.</b>

17:40.760 --> 17:42.430
<b>What a surprise.</b>

17:42.810 --> 17:45.190
<b>Are you sure I should play?</b>

17:45.390 --> 17:48.230
<b>You spent so much time practicing in the park.</b>

17:48.400 --> 17:49.190
<b>Go for it.</b>

17:50.520 --> 17:51.780
<b>Thanks, girls.</b>

17:52.980 --> 17:54.190
<b>It's time.</b>

17:54.690 --> 17:55.280
<b>Alright.</b>

17:59.490 --> 18:00.330
<b><i>Look up, Hina.</i></b>

18:00.910 --> 18:01.580
<b>Up?</b>

18:02.240 --> 18:03.330
<b><i>To the left, Hina.</i></b>

18:04.250 --> 18:05.290
<b>To the left?</b>

18:07.000 --> 18:07.830
<b>**TOGENASHI TOGEARI**</b>

18:08.000 --> 18:09.210
<b><i>Got you good</i></b>

18:09.710 --> 18:11.840
<b>- She annoys me…
- She’s funny.</b>

18:12.000 --> 18:15.380
<b>It's like she doesn’t want you to give up.</b>

18:15.760 --> 18:16.630
<b>How so?</b>

18:16.800 --> 18:19.180
<b>She went out of her way for you to apologize</b>

18:19.470 --> 18:21.600
<b>knowing you wouldn't.</b>

18:21.760 --> 18:24.560
<b>Yes, you're a bit like the boss of a game.</b>

18:24.720 --> 18:27.140
<b>The most annoying moral guardian in the universe.</b>

18:27.440 --> 18:31.020
<b>Beating you means finishing the game, but she keeps wanting more.</b>

18:31.310 --> 18:32.770
<b>That’s no comfort to me.</b>

18:33.070 --> 18:34.230
<b>It’s a compliment.</b>

18:34.400 --> 18:36.110
<b>You know I’m right.</b>

18:36.280 --> 18:38.610
<b>It’s time, girls.</b>

18:37.570 --> 18:40.530
<b>**STAGE LEFT NO SMOKING**</b>

18:54.750 --> 18:56.970
<b><i>Uh… you already know this,</i></b>

18:57.130 --> 19:00.090
<b><i>but we’re facing Diamond Dust.</i></b>

19:00.260 --> 19:01.760
<b><i>We can guess the outcome…</i></b>

19:02.680 --> 19:05.100
<b><i>Thank you for coming today!</i></b>

19:06.060 --> 19:07.270
<b>Ouch.</b>

19:10.060 --> 19:12.980
<b><i>You know, we really wracked our brains.</i></b>

19:13.310 --> 19:15.230
<b><i>We really wanted to win.</i></b>

19:15.400 --> 19:16.570
<b><i>Not bow down.</i></b>

19:16.900 --> 19:19.570
<b><i>And we put our hearts into the festival.</i></b>

19:21.910 --> 19:23.950
<b><i>I want to talk about myself.</i></b>

19:24.580 --> 19:25.910
<b><i>Is it okay, Rupa?</i></b>

19:27.450 --> 19:31.460
<b><i>When I was in high school, I tried to help a girl.</i></b>

19:31.960 --> 19:36.000
<b><i>Leaving the classroom, I was happy to have made that decision.</i></b>

19:36.590 --> 19:39.800
<b><i>I felt proud, at peace with myself.</i></b>

19:40.340 --> 19:43.890
<b><i>But it made me the new target,</i></b>

19:44.180 --> 19:46.100
<b><i>and I had to drop out of school.</i></b>

19:46.810 --> 19:50.020
<b><i>But not once did I regret going through with it.</i></b>

19:50.190 --> 19:54.190
<b><i>Not once did I think I could have avoided it.</i></b>

19:55.020 --> 19:59.740
<b><i>That's when I realized I had no regrets at all.</i></b>

20:00.360 --> 20:03.530
<b><i>Momoka’s song gave me the strength I lacked,</i></b>

20:04.280 --> 20:06.280
<b><i>and Hina knew that perfectly well.</i></b>

20:10.330 --> 20:11.040
<b><i>Oh, right.</i></b>

20:12.540 --> 20:16.210
<b><i>Hina was also a fan. Of DD’s music.</i></b>

20:17.340 --> 20:20.630
<b><i>It wasn’t just my song. It belongs to her too.</i></b>

20:23.510 --> 20:26.550
<b><i>Thank you again for coming.</i></b>

20:26.970 --> 20:29.890
<b><i>You are the rebels who go against the grain.</i></b>

20:30.430 --> 20:33.190
<b><i>And I love nonconformists like you.</i></b>

20:33.940 --> 20:37.110
<b><i>I will scream. Scream that we won’t give up.</i></b>

20:37.270 --> 20:38.690
<b><i>That we were right!</i></b>

20:39.320 --> 20:42.900
<b><i>Be witnesses to our birth!</i></b>

20:48.540 --> 20:52.750
<b><i>We all live similar lives</i></b>

20:53.000 --> 20:58.500
<b><i>And if you can't find your place</i></b>

20:58.670 --> 21:01.130
<b><i>Fly boldly</i></b>

21:01.300 --> 21:06.010
<b><i>Entwined destinies resonating, I've had enough of wandering</i></b>

21:06.180 --> 21:10.720
<b><i>I will devote my days to singing by your side</i></b>

21:10.890 --> 21:15.600
<b><i>Neither light nor draft like a solitary prison</i></b>

21:15.770 --> 21:22.400
<b><i>Pain and suffering, scars in excess</i></b>

21:22.570 --> 21:25.860
<b><i>Even with my clipped wings</i></b>

21:26.030 --> 21:31.240
<b><i>In the deepest darkness, I will keep singing</i></b>

21:32.410 --> 21:35.580
<b><i>I had taken flight only to disappear</i></b>

21:35.750 --> 21:38.250
<b><i>But now I want to stay</i></b>

21:38.420 --> 21:42.550
<b><i>I picked a budding bloom, awaiting its flowering</i></b>

21:42.710 --> 21:45.800
<b><i>The one who wished for nothingness is just a memory</i></b>

21:45.970 --> 21:48.300
<b><i>I am happy to live</i></b>

21:48.550 --> 21:55.480
<b><i>For chance put you on my path And thus blooms our flower of destiny</i></b>

22:16.620 --> 22:17.920
<b><i>Three, two, one…</i></b>

22:18.380 --> 22:22.920
<b><i>Thank you very much!</i></b>

22:32.390 --> 22:34.850
<b>Nina Iseri: Rina Momoka Kawaragi: Yûri</b>

22:36.480 --> 22:39.850
<b>Subaru Awa: Mirei Tomo Ebizuka: Natsu</b>

22:40.900 --> 22:44.280
<b>Rupa: Shuri Hina: Reina Kondô</b>

23:48.010 --> 23:51.130
<b>Translation & Subtitles: JSICMF Proofreading: Sarah Courchay</b>
